@startuml
actor User
participant "lsw" as CLI
participant "lswd" as Daemon
participant "ssh" as SSH
participant "Windows OpenSSH" as WinSSH
participant "PowerShell" as PS

User -> CLI : lsw
CLI -> Daemon : shell { cwd }
Daemon -> Daemon : linux_to_z(cwd, home)
Daemon --> CLI : ssh 参数
CLI -> SSH : exec ssh -t ...
SSH -> WinSSH : 连接 127.0.0.1:2222
WinSSH -> PS : powershell.exe -NoLogo -NoExit
PS --> User : 交互式终端
@enduml